{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "config:GateServer/CMakeLists.txt",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "CMakeLists.txt",
      "filePath": "GateServer/CMakeLists.txt",
      "summary": "GateServer 的 CMake 构建配置文件，定义了 C++17 编译标准，配置 Boost、jsoncpp、Protobuf、gRPC、hiredis 和 MySQL Connector/C++ 等依赖，并声明 protobuf/gRPC 代码生成规则。",
      "tags": ["build-system", "cmake", "c++", "protobuf", "grpc"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:GateServer/config.ini",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "config.ini",
      "filePath": "GateServer/config.ini",
      "summary": "GateServer 运行时配置文件，包含 HTTP 网关监听地址（0.0.0.0:8080）、Redis 连接参数、MySQL 数据库连接信息以及 UMSServer/TaskServer/StatusServer 的 gRPC 端点地址。",
      "tags": ["configuration", "runtime", "database", "redis", "grpc"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "schema:GateServer/message.proto",
      "type": "schema",
      "name": "message.proto",
      "filePath": "GateServer/message.proto",
      "summary": "GateServer 的 Protobuf IDL 文件，定义了整个系统的 API 契约，包含 UserService（用户认证与管理）、MailerService（邮件验证）、StatusService（在线状态与推送调度）、PushService（WebSocket 消息推送）和 TaskService（任务、TODO、签到）共 5 个 gRPC 服务、35 个 RPC 方法和 80 个消息类型。",
      "tags": ["protobuf", "grpc", "api-schema", "service-definition", "rpc"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Proto 文件采用经典的 Req/Rsp 消息对模式，所有响应均包含 error 字段用于统一错误码返回。TaskInfo 消息包含 assignee_statuses 嵌套消息用于支持多分配人独立状态追踪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "endpoint:GateServer/message.proto:UserService.Register",
      "type": "endpoint",
      "name": "UserService.Register",
      "filePath": "GateServer/message.proto",
      "lineRange": [9, 9],
      "summary": "用户注册 RPC，接收用户名、邮箱、密码和验证码，返回注册结果。",
      "tags": ["user-service", "authentication", "rpc"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
